  "57300461-f053-45ba-9cc0-a4c0a4ea11a7"],
 " is the degree of the Poincar\[EAcute] duality algebra. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["pairing", "TI"], "[", "\"\<Degree\>\"", "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"1c6ee480-fe36-4ee7-8f0f-5fd63ece3991"],
 " gives ",
 Cell[BoxData[
