  "7c5f81fb-7247-4ed6-8c3b-3ed4a475f85e"],
 " use when none is given."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"3e658e27-51d5-468a-8246-415615418ce7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A scalar multiple has the degree of what it multiplies, a power ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", 
    StyleBox["g", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "30474bfe-bdce-4d43-be4b-b7846e89684c"],
 " has ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["g", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "c8146efe-cf88-4714-8fcd-097ac60b9137"],
 " times the degree of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["HBar"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/HBar", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "aa090f1e-3c1c-422e-9ede-0a39e8ad6ba8"],
 ", and a sum has a degree when all its terms have the same one."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"62f1c66b-d937-4fa0-b614-530204b424b3"],

Cell["\<\
A scalar multiple of a letter counts only when the scalar contains no letter.\
\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"15073c3c-d095-4461-9a58-d83534a1fdb8"],

Cell["\<\
The letters of the dual alphabet of a pairing object have their degrees too.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"b2e85813-762e-42a6-988a-c133772abdc1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In the bar grading ",
 StyleBox["pairing", "TI"],
 " may also be an association from letters to degrees."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"9f9a2156-e3f9-40ba-858d-069913fe9f95"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A sum of mixed degree, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
 "0"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"e3063c22-3abc-4e90-af10-d3fbef698ab0"],
 ", a bare scalar, a letter outside the alphabet, and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["HBar"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/HBar", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "346a64f1-3f81-4094-94b1-14480275729f"],
 " in the bar or exterior grading return unevaluated."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"fad672d6-a3db-45ec-a0c7-ebd25e499823"]
